<title>UK: Capital Corp issues writ against ex-director.</title>
<headline>Capital Corp issues writ against ex-director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British casino operator Capital Corp Plc said on Tuesday it had issued a writ in the High Court against a former director and two ex-employees &quot;for conspiracy to injure the company and other matters arising since 1996&quot;.</p>
<p>Capital Corp said it had taken this step -- against former director Kenneth Thompson and ex-employees Desmond Pereira and Guy Hutchinson -- to defend the value of the business.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is greatly concerned that the selective use of company papers in the press is creating a false and misleading impression as to the true value of its business and its operating controls,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
